## Interface: 16001
## Title: Alchemy GPS
## Notes: Minimap module, built by porting Carbonite's real undocked-map code. See the build plan.
## Author: Digital Alchemyst
## Version: 0.1.0-dev
## SavedVariables: AlchemyGPSDB
## DefaultState: Enabled
## OptionalDeps: GatherMate2
# Gathering-node field (step 9e, MinimapEngine.lua). Reads GatherMate2's
# own live database directly (GetNodesForZone/DecodeLoc/nodeTextures) -
# whatever the player has gathered or imported through GatherMate2's
# own UI, no local copy, no Carbonite anywhere in this addon (this
# project exists to phase Carbonite OUT, so depending on
# Carbonite.Gathermate2_Data was explicitly rejected - that addon hard-
# requires Carbonite itself, which this addon's own user doesn't even
# run). This addon never calls LoadAddOn on anything - an earlier
# attempt to force-load a Wowhead data pack ourselves tripped a real
# Blizzard "blocked from an action only available to the Blizzard UI"
# popup on this server; GatherMate2 has its own first-party import
# button (/gathermate -> Import tab) for that, triggered by the
# player's own click, which is the only sanctioned way to do it here.
# Every call site guards safely; nothing here breaks without GatherMate2
# present, it just shows no gathering nodes.

# Phase 3: window chrome. Locales/Util must load before UI (Window.lua
# reads locale strings and Util helpers at file scope); UI before Map/
# Settings so MinimapWindow:Open() and the Settings window have the
# ported Nx.Window / AlchemyGPS.UI.Window chrome to build on.

Libs\libs.xml

Core\Core.xml
Compat\Compat.xml
Locales\Locales.xml
Util\Util.xml
UI\UI.xml
Map\Map.xml
Settings\Settings.xml
